target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8USbXkW0W8w</a> )<br /> <br /> The Heart-Stirring Anthem to arguably *the* Best Heroic-Fantasy* series of the last decade encapsulates the Nobility, Courage, Selflessness, Honor and above all HOPE that all True Warriors like the Garou Strive to Stand For And Defend. Few Anthems awaken the Hero Withing Your Heart more powerfully than &quot;SWORDLAND&quot; does.<br /> <br /> More to come tomorrow. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4684-lin-liren","name":"Lin Liren","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-26T19:25:30-08:00","id":1008750,"title":"","content":"Ok, I need to summon a Moderator. So i might have to break the rules just so they can show up...Get ready for Nude Pictures, Everyone!!<br /> <br /> Now that i have your attention, can someone pin this thread on the werewolf subforum please?.<br /> <br /> Also: Wolf's Rain.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-26T19:35:31-08:00","id":1008760,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1007357-inspiration-for-werewolf?p=1008750#post1008750\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also: Wolf's Rain.</div> </div> </div> </div> I <i>still</i> haven't finished Wolf's Rain, but from what little I saw it seemed very Werewolf, and not just because of the inclusion of wolves. It reminded me a lot of a pack and a Kami.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><a href=\"http://thecyberrecord.net\" target=\"_blank\">The Cyber Record</a> is on the </span></b><a href=\"http://geomid.network\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Geomid.Network</span></b></a><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Activism is Gaian praxis</span></b></div> <div align=\"right\"> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" ><img itemprop=\"image\" data-align=\"center\" data-linktype=\"1\" data-linkurl=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" data-size=\"full\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-thumb-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center\" /></a></div><br /> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2810-yakecen-sings","name":"Yakecen-Sings","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2810_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-26T19:49:01-08:00","id":1008768,"title":"","content":"Twin Peaks and its cartoon descendant Gravity Falls are great examples of how threats from the Umbra are interpreted by mortals and defeated in the Realm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-27T18:54:01-08:00","id":1009119,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://engl210-deykute.wikispaces.umb.edu/file/view/omelas.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://engl210-deykute.wikispaces.um...iew/omelas.pdf</a> A great look into the place of a metis in more traditional tribes and how cubs would react to it and rationalize it. Or won't.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":110,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","user":"Ana Mizuki","date":". 11-27-2016, 10:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-28T07:30:53-08:00","id":1009321,"title":"","content":"<b>TV Shows</b><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt2365946/\" target=\"_blank\">Bitten</a>: I'm honestly a little surprised this wasn't mentioned already. Pack interactions at it's best.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt1595680/\" target=\"_blank\">Being Human</a>: Includes a vampire and a ghost, but the werewolf stuff is good. I prefer the US version over the UK, but both are good.<br /> <br /> <b>Movies</b><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0397044/\" target=\"_blank\">Blood &amp; Chocolate</a>: Another good werewolf flick, if not perfect for WtA<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0461703/\" target=\"_blank\">Skinwalkers</a>: Werewolf on werewolf action<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1885-crackedman","name":"CrackedMan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1885_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-28T08:41:45-08:00","id":1009345,"title":"","content":"TV:<br /> Werewolf: Make the Hulk a werewolf, shorten the episodes to 30 minutes, with Chuck Connors and Brian Thompson as villains. Stand back I'm going to throw all my money at the screen!<br /> Quincy MD: Only for one episode. Quincy finds out from the dead that a major corporation is breaking regulations by venting toxic gasses during the smog alert. Quincy would be a Glass Walker Kinfolk.<br /> History's Mysteries: One short and a full episode. Basically it's the basic lore of Werewolves. Also my introduction to Werewolf and WoD.<br /> Lost Tapes: Great found footage tv series. The Werewolf episode is obvious. The rest are great for Totems and villains.<br /> <br /> Film:<br /> The Howling: A news anchor investigating a serial killer ends up at an medical colony which is a sept of Ronin Garou.<br /> The Wolfman 09: Classic is already covered. So I'm chipping in the B film. Antony Hopkins as a Silver Fang Ronin, and Hugo Weaving as a Hunter about to turn Garou. It's still a great film.<br /> American Werewolf in London: Great special effects. Gotta love when your first changes happens abroad with no one to teach you.<br /> House of 1000 Corpses: Going to the villains side. A Formori family in 1978 Texas captures and terrorizes a group of college kids who are attempting to write about roadside attractions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-28T20:41:40-08:00","id":1009622,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=k5WQZzDRVtw&amp;feature=youtu.be/&quot;\" target=\"_blank\">The Babadook</a> is a great example of a Bane stalking a family and attempting to possess and feed off of a human.<br /> <br /> GLaDOS from Portal also reminds me of a crazed Weaver spirit. A great deal of the Portal 2 soundtrack is something I would use when dealing with either murderous Weaver spirits or corrupted blights, factories, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":3198,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/me